        <p>13. The product, accessories, and package may vary in different markets. Pictures are for reference only. Please refer to the actual products.</p>
        <p>14. Dual 4G SIM requires the support of local telecom operator services, it may not be available in all regions.</p>
        <p>15. Whether you can use VoLTE depends on the local carriers, please note that not all of your local carriers support this function.</p>
        <p>16.  Armor Molle Holster, Armor Mount Pro, Armor Mount (Next-Gen), Sports Armband are all sold separately.</p>
        <p>17. Wear and tear for daily use or serious drops may weaken or invalidate the phone waterproofing.</p>
        <p>18.Third-party app audio recording depends on the app's features and permissions. Check the specific app for details.</p>
        <p>19. Capacity and usage hours are verified via Ulefone lab tests; actual results may vary.</p>
